<title>ITALY: GERMANY'S TIETMEYER SAYS ECONOMY ON UPTURN.</title>
<headline>GERMANY'S TIETMEYER SAYS ECONOMY ON UPTURN.</headline>
<dateline>CERNOBBIO, Italy 1996-09-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>German Bundesbank president Hans Tietmeyer said the German economy is clearly on a new cyclical upturn, but said one should not overestimate figures for second quarter growth.</p>
</text>
